    "srn": "Yu no kan piki a plan dya: Yu o pasa a storage limit. Begi yu figi wan taki files foswan.",
    "ss": "Ngeke ukwati kukhetsa lelihlelo: Utadlula inani lekugcina. Ngicela ususe ema-file lamange kukaloku.",
